            <p class="product-description">The Nissan Patrol is a full-size luxury SUV renowned for its off-road prowess and spacious interior. With body-on-frame construction and advanced 4WD systems, it can tackle the toughest terrain while providing premium comfort for all occupants.</p>
            <div class="product-price-container">
